    "updated_at": "2024-10-29T09:57:28Z",
    "body": "@ArthurSonzogni - I now believe that returning the non-null WindowProxy in case of a BCG change is significantly better, as it still enables communication with the popup. (I don't fully understand the detached frame scenario you mentioned, so have no strong opinions about it)\r\n\r\n",
